Implemented: parallel ordered scan with a byte-level regex prefilter, repeatable --search with --regex, X-Match context, path order with --offset/X-Next, --sort state. 50k issues: --search 1.82s → 0.39s (rg 0.27s), list 1.96s → 0.14s.

